function timerHtml(step){var m=String(step).match(/(\d+)\s*(?:-\s*(\d+)\s*)?(minutes?|mins?|hours?|hrs?|seconds?|secs?)/i); if(!m)return ''; var n=parseInt(m[2]||m[1],10), unit=m[3].toLowerCase(); var sec=n*(/hour|hr/.test(unit)?3600:/sec/.test(unit)?1:60); return ' <span class="timer"><button data-timer="'+sec+'">Start '+n+' '+(/hour|hr/.test(unit)?'hr':/sec/.test(unit)?'sec':'min')+' timer</button><span class="small" data-tleft></span></span>'}
var _timerButtons={};
function fmtClock(sec){sec=Math.max(0,Math.round(sec)); var h=Math.floor(sec/3600),m=Math.floor((sec%3600)/60),x=sec%60; return (h?h+':':'')+m+':'+('0'+x).slice(-2)}
function timerRemaining(t){if(!t)return 0; if(t.paused)return t.remaining||0; return Math.max(0,Math.round((t.endsAt-Date.now())/1000))}
function getTimer(id){return (state.timers||[]).find(function(t){return t.id===id})}
function addTimer(label,sec,meta){var t=Object.assign({id:uid(),label:String(label||'Timer'),total:sec,endsAt:Date.now()+sec*1000,paused:false,remaining:sec,done:false},meta||{}); state.timers=(state.timers||[]); state.timers.push(t); saveLocalOnly(); renderTimerWidgets(); toast('Timer started: '+t.label); return t}
function pauseTimer(id){var t=getTimer(id); if(!t||t.paused)return; t.remaining=timerRemaining(t); t.paused=true; saveLocalOnly(); renderTimerWidgets()}
function resumeTimer(id){var t=getTimer(id); if(!t)return; t.endsAt=Date.now()+(t.remaining||0)*1000; t.paused=false; t.done=false; saveLocalOnly(); renderTimerWidgets()}
function removeTimer(id){state.timers=(state.timers||[]).filter(function(t){return t.id!==id}); delete _timerButtons[id]; saveLocalOnly(); renderTimerWidgets()}
function tickTimers(){var now=Date.now(); (state.timers||[]).forEach(function(t){if(!t.paused && !t.done && t.endsAt<=now){t.done=true; t.remaining=0; try{navigator.vibrate&&navigator.vibrate([200,100,200])}catch(e){} try{if(typeof Notification!=='undefined'&&Notification.permission==='granted') new Notification('Timer finished: '+t.label)}catch(e){} toast('Timer finished: '+t.label)}}); renderTimerWidgets()}
function renderTimerWidgets(){var list=state.timers||[]; var active=list.filter(function(t){return !t.done && (t.paused||timerRemaining(t)>0)}); var bt=document.getElementById('btnTimers'); if(bt)bt.textContent='Timers'+(active.length?(' ('+active.length+')'):''); var bar=document.getElementById('timerBar'); if(bar){if(!active.length){bar.style.display='none'; bar.innerHTML=''} else {bar.style.display='block'; bar.innerHTML=active.slice(0,4).map(function(t){return '<div class="timerbar-row"><span>'+esc(t.label)+'</span><strong>'+(t.paused?fmtClock(t.remaining||0)+' paused':fmtClock(timerRemaining(t)))+'</strong></div>'}).join('')+(active.length>4?'<div class="small">+'+(active.length-4)+' more?</div>':'')+'<div class="small">Click for timer dashboard</div>'}}
 var dl=document.getElementById('timerList'); var dg=document.getElementById('dTimers'); if(dl && dg && dg.open){var all=list.slice().sort(function(a,b){return (a.done?1:0)-(b.done?1:0)||((a.endsAt||0)-(b.endsAt||0))}); dl.innerHTML=all.length?all.map(function(t){var r=timerRemaining(t); var st=t.done?'Finished':(t.paused?'Paused ? '+fmtClock(t.remaining||0):fmtClock(r)+' left'); return '<div class="itemrow"><div style="flex:1"><strong>'+esc(t.label)+'</strong><div class="small">'+st+(t.recipeTitle?' ? '+esc(t.recipeTitle):'')+'</div></div><span style="display:flex;gap:6px">'+(t.done?'':'<button data-tpause="'+t.id+'">'+(t.paused?'Resume':'Pause')+'</button>')+'<button data-trm="'+t.id+'">Remove</button></span></div>'}).join(''):'<div class="small">No timers. Start one above or from a recipe step.</div>'; dl.onclick=function(e){var pb=e.target.closest('button[data-tpause]'); if(pb){var t=getTimer(pb.dataset.tpause); if(t){t.paused?resumeTimer(t.id):pauseTimer(t.id)} return} var rb=e.target.closest('button[data-trm]'); if(rb)removeTimer(rb.dataset.trm)}}
 Object.keys(_timerButtons).forEach(function(id){var reg=_timerButtons[id]; var t=getTimer(id); if(!t){reg.btn.textContent='Timer'; if(reg.lab)reg.lab.textContent=' stopped'; delete _timerButtons[id]; return} var r=timerRemaining(t); reg.btn.textContent=t.done?'Timer':(t.paused?'Resume':'Pause'); if(reg.lab)reg.lab.textContent=' '+(t.done?'done':(t.paused?fmtClock(t.remaining||0)+' paused':fmtClock(r)))})}
function wireTimers(root){root.querySelectorAll('button[data-timer]').forEach(function(b){if(b._wired)return; b._wired=true; b.onclick=function(){var sec=+b.dataset.timer; var lab=b.parentNode.querySelector('[data-tleft]'); var li=b.closest?b.closest('li'):null; var snippet=''; if(li){snippet=li.textContent.replace(/Start\s+\d+.*?timer/i,'').replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim().slice(0,60)} var t=b._timerId?getTimer(b._timerId):null; if(t){t.paused?resumeTimer(t.id):pauseTimer(t.id); return} t=addTimer(snippet||('Step timer ('+Math.round(sec/60)+' min)'), sec, {}); b._timerId=t.id; _timerButtons[t.id]={btn:b,lab:lab}; renderTimerWidgets()}})}
setInterval(tickTimers,1000);
(function(){var b=document.getElementById('btnTimers'); if(b)b.onclick=function(){renderTimerWidgets(); document.getElementById('dTimers').showModal()}; var c=document.getElementById('timerClose'); if(c)c.onclick=function(){document.getElementById('dTimers').close()}; var a=document.getElementById('timerAddBtn'); if(a)a.onclick=function(){var l=(document.getElementById('timerLabel').value||'').trim()||'Timer'; var m=parseFloat(document.getElementById('timerMin').value); if(!m||m<=0){toast('Enter minutes');return} addTimer(l,Math.round(m*60),{}); document.getElementById('timerLabel').value=''; document.getElementById('timerMin').value=''}; var cd=document.getElementById('timerClearDone'); if(cd)cd.onclick=function(){state.timers=(state.timers||[]).filter(function(t){return !t.done}); saveLocalOnly(); renderTimerWidgets()}; var bar=document.getElementById('timerBar'); if(bar)bar.onclick=function(){renderTimerWidgets(); document.getElementById('dTimers').showModal()}})();
function toMarkdown(r,f){var out='# '+r.title+'\n\n'; if(r.servings||r.time)out+= [r.servings,r.time].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')+'\n\n'; out+='## Ingredients\n'+(r.ing||[]).map(function(i){return '- '+fmtIng(i,f||1)}).join('\n')+'\n\n## Steps\n'+(r.steps||[]).map(function(i,n){return (n+1)+'. '+i}).join('\n'); if(r.equip&&r.equip.length)out+='\n\n## Equipment\n'+r.equip.map(function(i){return '- '+i}).join('\n'); if(r.nutrition)out+='\n\n## Nutrition (estimate)\n'+r.nutrition; if(r.notes)out+='\n\n## Notes\n'+r.notes; if(r.src)out+='\n\nSource: '+r.src; return out}
function copyText(t){if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(t)}else{var a=document.createElement('textarea');a.value=t;document.body.appendChild(a);a.select();document.execCommand('copy');a.remove()}}
function openCook(r,factor){$('cookBody').innerHTML='<h2 style="margin-top:0">'+esc(r.title)+'</h2><p class="small">'+esc([r.servings,r.time].filter(Boolean).join(' · '))+'</p><h3>Ingredients</h3><ul class="cook">'+r.ing.map(function(i){return '<li><label class="ck"><input type="checkbox"> '+esc(fmtIng(i,factor||1))+'</label></li>'}).join('')+'</ul><h3>Steps</h3><ol class="cook">'+r.steps.map(function(s,i){return '<li><label class="ck"><input type="checkbox"> <strong>'+ (i+1)+'.</strong> '+esc(s)+'</label>'+timerHtml(s)+'</li>'}).join('')+'</ol><div class="row"><button class="primary" id="cookClose">Close</button></div>'; $('cookClose').onclick=function(){$('dCook').close()}; wireTimers($('cookBody')); $('dCook').showModal();}
function renderShopUI(){var el=document.getElementById('shopList'); if(!el)return; var items=state.shopDone['__items__']||[]; var groups={}; items.forEach(function(it,i){var a=it.aisle||guessAisle(it.text); (groups[a]=groups[a]||[]).push({it:it,i:i})}); var aisles=Object.keys(groups).sort(); el.innerHTML=aisles.length?aisles.map(function(a){return '<div><div class="pill" style="margin:6px 0">'+esc(a)+'</div>'+groups[a].map(function(x){return '<div class="itemrow"><label class="ck" style="flex:1"><input type="checkbox" data-si="'+x.i+'" '+(x.it.done?'checked':'')+'> '+esc(x.it.text)+'</label><button data-sd="'+x.i+'" aria-label="Remove">?</button></div>'}).join('')+'</div>'}).join(''):'<div class="small">No items yet. Open a recipe and click "Add to list", add planned meals, pick a recipe, or type a custom item.</div>'; el.onchange=function(e){var cb=e.target.closest('input[data-si]'); if(!cb)return; var idx=+cb.dataset.si; if(items[idx])items[idx].done=cb.checked; save()}; el.onclick=function(e){var b=e.target.closest('button[data-sd]'); if(!b)return; items.splice(+b.dataset.sd,1); save(); renderShopUI()}; var sel=document.getElementById('shopAddRecipe'); if(sel){sel.innerHTML='<option value="">Add ingredients from a recipe?</option>'+state.recipes.slice().sort(function(a,b){return a.title.localeCompare(b.title)}).map(function(r){return '<option value="'+esc(r.id)+'">'+esc(r.title)+'</option>'}).join('');}}
function renderPlanUI(){if(!document.getElementById('planAdd'))return; $('planAdd').innerHTML='<option value="">Select...</option>'+state.recipes.slice().sort(function(a,b){return a.title.localeCompare(b.title)}).map(function(r){return '<option value="'+esc(r.id)+'">'+esc(r.title)+'</option>'}).join(''); $('planList').innerHTML=state.plan.length?state.plan.map(function(id,i){var r=state.recipes.find(function(x){return x.id===id}); return '<div class="itemrow"><div style="flex:1">'+esc(r?r.title:'(missing)')+'</div><span style="display:flex;gap:6px"><button data-shop="'+esc(id)+'">Add to list</button><button data-rm="'+i+'">Remove</button></span></div>'}).join(''):'<div class="small">No meals planned.</div>'; $('planList').onclick=function(e){var s=e.target.closest('button[data-shop]'); if(s){var r=state.recipes.find(function(x){return x.id===s.dataset.shop}); if(r){addToShop(r,1); toast('Added "'+r.title+'" to shopping list');} return} var b=e.target.closest('button[data-rm]'); if(!b)return; state.plan.splice(+b.dataset.rm,1); save(); renderPlanUI()}; }
function renderPlan(){renderPlanUI(); renderShopUI()}
